 "remarks": "This updated two-bedroom townhouse offers the best of both worlds - low-maintenance living with the feel of a private home. Set in a garden-style community with its own private entrance, this unit is bright, well-designed, and move-in ready.  The layout includes two bedrooms, one full bath, and a half bath, plus a private outdoor deck for grilling, working from home, or just catching some sun. The kitchen features updated finishes in neutral tones, offering a clean, modern look that blends easily with any style. Located just off Newfield Avenue, you're around the corner from the Newfield Green Shopping Center, and minutes from downtown, the train, and commuter routes. It's an ideal spot for anyone who wants to be close to everything but still have a quiet place to recharge.",
